    {
      "id": "song-915",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "蝶恋花",
      "subtitle": "碾玉钗头双凤小",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "碾玉钗头双凤小。\n倒晕工夫，画得宫眉巧。\n嫩曲罗裙胜碧草。\n鸳鸯绣字春衫好。\n三月露桃芳意早。\n细看花枝，人面争多少。\n水调声长歌未了。\n掌中杯尽东池晓。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "ea5bcb71d4af58600763a4a0971af673ea4b81cc76009c813593a279847ee0dd",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-915--ea5bcb71d4af58600763a4a0971af673ea4b81cc76009c813593a279847ee0dd.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-916",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "蝶恋花",
      "subtitle": "欲减罗衣寒未去",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "欲减罗衣寒未去。\n不卷珠帘，人在深深处。\n残杏枝头花几许。\n啼红正恨清明雨。\n尽日沈香烟一缕。\n宿酒醒迟，恼破春情绪。\n远信还因归燕误。\n小屏风上西江路。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "53b7e30f1943289c91ee2673e708e96ef2f2c2b710cc6bef52b2e939876e9bf2",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-916--53b7e30f1943289c91ee2673e708e96ef2f2c2b710cc6bef52b2e939876e9bf2.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-917",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "蝶恋花",
      "subtitle": "千叶早梅夸百媚",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "千叶早梅夸百媚。\n笑面凌寒，内样妆先试。\n月脸冰肌香细腻。\n风流新称东君意。\n一捻年光春有味。\n江北江南，更有谁相比。\n横玉声中吹满地。\n好枝长恨无人寄。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c8f12aca41095780ba106603fa285c0092e83931baebf91fd2d34e2bdfd27fea",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-917--c8f12aca41095780ba106603fa285c0092e83931baebf91fd2d34e2bdfd27fea.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-918",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "蝶恋花",
      "subtitle": "金翦刀头芳意动",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "金翦刀头芳意动。\n彩蕊开时，不怕朝寒重。\n晴雪半消花䰒䰄。\n晓妆呵尽香酥冻。\n十二楼中双翠凤。\n缥缈歌声，记得江南弄。\n醉舞春风谁可共。\n秦云已有鸳屏梦。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "fdc28ccbc20aef000c62f674f729a6332d93350a77e5e8be452cfd07707eaf83",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-918--fdc28ccbc20aef000c62f674f729a6332d93350a77e5e8be452cfd07707eaf83.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-919",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "蝶恋花",
      "subtitle": "笑艳秋莲生绿浦",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "笑艳秋莲生绿浦。\n红脸青腰，旧识凌波女。\n照影弄妆娇欲语。\n西风岂是繁华主。\n可恨良辰天不与。\n才过斜阳，又是黄昏雨。\n朝落暮开空自许。\n竟无人解知心苦。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "850ac3103b877bcd99540e0bb8cdc2e0a035c5e16a83147e2a4c4d3fdaf6fafb",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-919--850ac3103b877bcd99540e0bb8cdc2e0a035c5e16a83147e2a4c4d3fdaf6fafb.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-920",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "蝶恋花",
      "subtitle": "碧玉高楼临水住",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "碧玉高楼临水住。\n红杏开时，花底曾相遇。\n一曲阳春春已暮。\n晓莺声断朝云去。\n远水来从楼下路。\n过尽流波，未得鱼中素。\n月细风尖垂柳渡。\n梦魂长在分襟处。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "7ce7f9a4fa2f243eba5ab6da8437115ae54b646156e0b79b1893776018625b53",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-920--7ce7f9a4fa2f243eba5ab6da8437115ae54b646156e0b79b1893776018625b53.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-921",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "蝶恋花",
      "subtitle": "黄菊开时伤聚散",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "黄菊开时伤聚散。\n曾记花前，共说深深愿。\n重见金英人未见。\n相思一夜天涯远。\n罗带同心闲结遍。\n带易成双，人恨成双晚。\n欲写彩笺书别怨。\n泪痕早已先书满。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "d8c3206f2850781297adeb7355e20da86ba1463ed2d3905d653cd5c297d4a882",
      "estimatedOutput": 754,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-921--d8c3206f2850781297adeb7355e20da86ba1463ed2d3905d653cd5c297d4a882.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-922",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "鹧鸪天",
      "subtitle": "彩袖殷勤捧玉锺",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "彩袖殷勤捧玉锺。\n当年拼却醉颜红。\n舞低杨柳楼心月，歌尽桃花扇影风。\n从别后，忆相逢。\n几回魂梦与君同。\n今宵剩把银釭照，犹恐相逢是梦中。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "80892e3576f7d1584fd15e170ff5b8a9c931e207c21052f5c64b1bc1aa2568d9",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
